# Local dev build artifacts
web-terminal-server-bin
/web-terminal-server
# The wirecheck helper, built from scripts/wirecheck/. Anchored so the SOURCE
# directory (scripts/wirecheck/) stays tracked and only the root binary is
# ignored; it is 6 MB and was one `git add -A` away from the history.
/wirecheck
build/
node_modules/

# Generated browser assets (the dev-build script / Dockerfile produce these;
# only static/index.html is committed so go:embed has content).
static/vendor/
static/style.css
# scripts/css-bundle.sh assembles into a mktemp sibling and renames only on
# success, so a SIGKILLed run leaves one behind.
static/style.css.*

# Local-dev workspace file (resolves the unpublished engine from ../vterm)
go.work
go.work.sum

# Kiro skill artifacts (app-review, code-review, refactor, steering-maintenance, judgement)
**/.app-review/
**/.code-review/
**/.judgement/
**/.refactor/
**/.steering-maintenance/
